codex
The pattern is clear now: the last shot per context has the exact authored anchor camera while earlier reads show a far, wide pose — the inspection camera eases from the narrative pose on entry, and my reads raced that blend (the raw PNGs for those targets are mid-blend and unusable). The narrow slider loss looks like a context decay issue. I'll rewrite the helper: fresh context per target, and poll until the applied camera matrix converges before every screenshot.
